      "id": "pacer_vs_reflex_only_uncapped",
      "candidate": "B",
      "baseline": "R0u",
      "question": "With frame generation, does the balanced pacer at the cap pace better than the game's own Reflex alone with ReLimiter's cap off, and what does it cost in latency?"
    }
